  "releaseNotes": "Add HttpModel base; refactor Request/Response:\n      - Introduce a new HttpModel base class that centralizes HTTP buffer, start-line, headers, cookies and body handling (parsing, building and pool lifecycle).\n      - RequestModel and ResponseModel now inherit from HttpModel and delegate/override behaviour (Clear, SetBegin, SetHeader/AddHeader, SetBody, SetContentType, ParseCookieHeader, Clone, etc.), removing large amounts of duplicated code and keeping only type-specific logic (e.g. Status field in ResponseModel).\n      - Affected files: + src/LuciferCore/Model/HttpModel.cs, modified src/LuciferCore/Model/RequestModel.cs and src/LuciferCore/Model/ResponseModel.cs. This reduces duplication and centralizes HTTP parsing/building logic for easier maintenance.",
